{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015nbwnyzSFDLRxhrmQH6tDm","type":"tool_result","content":"# offline replica, data as of 2026-05-01T00:00:00Z\nid:\t8a3a21f2b90819312447f34e\nlist:\tdev@kafka.apache.org\nfrom:\tAditya Kousik\ndate:\t2026-04-01T15:35:47Z\nsubject:\t[DISCUSS] KIP-1308: Extend RecordHeader API for Common Value Types\nthread:\tC4EFE94B-9E37-415D-BBE3-CCEBFE5F65CB@icloud.com\n\nHi all,\n\nI'd like to start a discussion on KIP-1308: Extend RecordHeader API for Common Value Types.\n\nhttps://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1308%3A+Extend+RecordHeader+API+for+Common+Value+Types\n\nPutting a string or int into a RecordHeader today requires manual byte encoding; reading it back requires the same in reverse. This KIP adds static factories (RecordHeader.ofString, ofInt, etc.) and corresponding typed accessors, with no wire format changes.\n\nLooking forward to your feedback.\n\nThanks,\nAditya Kousik","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2bdc0be4-9093-40b1-97b8-a699b708e7c0","uuid":"77ff38bd-1519-4c53-b185-ba886f354716","timestamp":"2026-09-27T19:44:05.699Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# offline replica, data as of 2026-05-01T00:00:00Z\nid:\t8a3a21f2b90819312447f34e\nlist:\tdev@kafka.apache.org\nfrom:\tAditya Kousik\ndate:\t2026-04-01T15:35:47Z\nsubject:\t[DISCUSS] KIP-1308: Extend RecordHeader API for Common Value Types\nthread:\tC4EFE94B-9E37-415D-BBE3-CCEBFE5F65CB@icloud.com\n\nHi all,\n\nI'd like to start a discussion on KIP-1308: Extend RecordHeader API for Common Value Types.\n\nhttps://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1308%3A+Extend+RecordHeader+API+for+Common+Value+Types\n\nPutting a string or int into a RecordHeader today requires manual byte encoding; reading it back requires the same in reverse. This KIP adds static factories (RecordHeader.ofString, ofInt, etc.) and corresponding typed accessors, with no wire format changes.\n\nLooking forward to your feedback.\n\nThanks,\nAditya Kousik","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
